The 14th of February.%K%P
－２月１４日－%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Hahh.\d%K%P
「…哈啊」%K%P
%LCWaitress
%LC服务员
\dMy apologies, but I'm afraid it is time for your last\norder.\d%K%P
「客人…非常抱歉，\n差不多到最后一单的时间了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...What time is it?\d%K%P
「…现在几点了？」%K%P
%LCWaitress
%LC服务员
\dHalf past eleven, Ma'am.\nWe are closing the shop at midnight, so...\d%K%P
「１１点半。\n我们是０点整打烊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see...\d%K%P
「是么…」%K%P
%LCWaitress
%LC服务员
\dShall I bring you another one of the same?\d%K%P
「要给您来一杯相同的吗？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Sure, that'll be fine.\nI'm sorry, but can I stay until closing time?\d%K%P
「…那，就麻烦你了。\n不好意思，我能一直待到你们打烊吗？」%K%P
%LCWaitress
%LC服务员
\dOf course, but... what about your...?\d%K%P
「那个没问题…\n不过您的同伴…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt looks like I've been rejected.\d%K%P
「看来我是被甩了啊…」%K%P
%LCWaitress
%LC服务员
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUgh, it's cold.\d%K%P
「好冷…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAt least call me if you've changed your mind.\nYou only ever show up when you're horny.\d%K%P
「不来的话好歹通知一声啊…\n明明只有在想的时候才叫我的，真是的」%K%P
%LCAnnouncer
%LC电话音
\d\dWe're sorry; you have reached a number that has been\ndisconnected or is no longer in service.\d\d%K%P
「您所拨打的电话目前不在服务区，\n或处于关机状态」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Wait, I was the one who told him I was fine with that.\nI actually brought this on myself, didn't I?\d%K%P
「…呃，说要这么做的人是我吧。\n这就是，自作自受？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell... it doesn't seem like any taxis are around.\nI wonder if the trains are still running.\d%K%P
「接下来…出租车看不到了，\n电车还在运行着吗？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMight as well try walking home for a change.\nShouldn't take more than an hour.\d%K%P
「偶尔…也走着回去吧。\n花上１个小时的话总能走到的吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...If my path weren't blocked by snow, that is.\d%K%P
「………如果没有下雪的话」%K%P
.........%K%P
………%K%P
......%K%P
……%K%P
...%K%P
…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu?\d%K%P
「理？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, Asami? Um... I'm sorry for today.\nI was the one who invited you, but I couldn't make it.\d%K%P
「啊，麻实…那个，今天抱歉了…\n明明是我邀请你的，却没有去」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, it's okay. What about you, though?\nDid they stop all the trains?\d%K%P
「不不，比起那个，你没事吧？\n电车停运了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, the trains ended up running behind schedule as far as\nI saw, but I don't think any have been cancelled yet.\d%K%P
「不…虽然时间表混乱了，\n不过最后总算是运行了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're not hurt, are you? Your leg just finished healing,\nso I'm actually glad you didn't risk it on a day like\nthis.\d%K%P
「有没有受伤？\n毕竟你骨折刚刚治好不久，\n像今天这样的天气，你没来真是太好了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou don't need to worry about that, I feel better than\never. But, um... something unavoidable suddenly came up,\nso...\d%K%P
「那个也没问题了。我现在身体好着呢。\n只是，那个…无论如何也脱不了身…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIs that so...? I imagine it must have been something\nbig.\d%K%P
「这样啊…真是辛苦啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「………抱歉」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou don't need to apologize.\nI didn't spend that much time waiting.\d%K%P
「理你不用道歉的。\n我又没有老实等着」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dR-Really...?\d%K%P
「是、是么…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dPutting that aside, are you really okay? I'll be mad if\nyou keep another injury from me again.\d%K%P
「比起那个，真的是什么也没发生么？\n事故啊受伤啊，如果这些事你瞒着我的话，我可饶不了你哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah, I'm safe and sound. You've got nothing to worry\nabout on that front. It's just that... I can't leave her\nalone right now...\d%K%P
「嗯，那些也没问题。\n只是…现在我得在身边跟着…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm really sorry! I'll make it up to you! I'll call you\nlater!\d%K%P
「真的很抱歉！\n下次我会补偿的。\n再联系啦！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUm, Osamu?\d%K%P
「那个，理？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnyway, it's getting late, so...\d%K%P
「那就这样，已经很晚了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh? Y-Yeah, I suppose so. Take care, then.\d%K%P
「诶？\n诶、诶诶…那就，回见」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm really sorry, Asami.\d%K%P
「………真的很抱歉，麻实」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...What the hell...?\d%K%P
「…什么嘛？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSeriously, what the hell was that?!\nI want my four hours back!\d%K%P
「他这什么意思吗。\n把我４个小时的时间还回来…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, it's not my time I want...\nI don't care if he came late, it would've been fine!\d%K%P
「不，想要你归还的不是时间…\n啊啊够了，现在就过来有什么不好的！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Now that I think about it, I had nothing but alcohol\ntonight.\d%K%P
「…话说回来，我只喝了酒吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI've got nothing in the fridge back home, either...\nWhatever, might as well eat the chocolate.\d%K%P
「晚饭，也是什么都没买…\n没办法了，把巧克力拆包吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThis was definitely... the most depressing Valentine's\nDay of my life.\d%K%P
「真是…\n好寂寞的情人节…」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
The 25th of February.%K%P
－２月２５日－%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Huh?\d%K%P
「…哈？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dSo... I was wondering if I should muster my courage and\nconfess on graduation day... or if I should just give up.\d%K%P
「所以…\n拿出勇气，在毕业典礼上表白？\n还是，就这样放弃…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWh-Wh-What?! Why are you asking me?!\d%K%P
「等、等、等、等一下啊！\n为什么要和我说这种事！？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dWell, you keep saying that we should never hesitate to\nask you for help if we ever found ourselves in trouble.\d%K%P
「因为老师您总是说\n『要是有困扰，无论是什么，都可以来商谈』…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI-I did say that, sure, but... I never expected to be\ndealing with issues like this!\d%K%P
「那、那个我说是说了…\n但就算是那样，这种青…娇嫩的商谈，我也没想到会有啊」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dListen, I'm serious!\nSo I want you to think about it seriously too!\d%K%P
「我，是认真的！\n所以也请老师认真回答我！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI think... you should first discuss that with your\nfriends...\d%K%P
「这、这种商谈首先应该找朋友…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dThere's no way I can tell Toko about it, and when I tried\nasking Rinko, she suddenly just ran off.\d%K%P
「又不可能去找小都子谈这种事…\n找伦子商谈，但不知为什么她风风火火地逃了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI-I see...\d%K%P
「是、是么…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dI've been watching Tsuyoshi since the day I enrolled at\nthis school. He was always energetic, decisive, really\ngood at sports... and pretty funny, too.\d%K%P
「从入学的时候开始我就一直关注着刚志君了。\n他开朗、有行动力、运动神经出类拔萃…有点幽默」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
%XS10\dHe sounds like the complete opposite of a certain someone I know.\d %XE%K%P
「果然和某个人完全相反啊，尾关君…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dA lot of girls had their eyes on him. He was just that\npopular. Up until my second year, I'd get glares every\ntime I went to talk to him.\d%K%P
「正因为他很受欢迎，所以很多女生都想追求他…\n二年级的时候，只是向他打招呼，都会遭到别人的怒视」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
%XS10\dI can definitely relate... I guess that's one thing they have in\ncommon.\d %XE%K%P
「这种压力，你也有印象啊…\n只有这种地方挺像的」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dThen in my third year, I ended up in the same class as\nToko and Rinko, who were friends with him. So that's when\nI finally managed to get closer to him.\d%K%P
「到了三年级，和小都子、伦子同班了，\n刚志君像朋友一样向她们两人说上话了，\n所以我也能向朋友一样和他说上话了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see...\d%K%P
「是啊…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dBut I know he doesn't view me that way at all...\nTo make matters worse, he's in love with one of my best\nfriends.\d%K%P
「但我是明白的。\n他的眼里完全没有我。\n不仅如此，他喜欢的人，是我的挚友…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dSo even if I confess now, the possibility of him\nreturning my feelings is pretty much zero. I realize that\nmuch myself.\d%K%P
「所以，即使我现在去表白，\n他同意的可能性极低。\n这种事，我明白」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI-In that case, maybe you should take it slow and keep an\neye on him for a while. I mean, you live close to each\nother, so you can meet anytime you want.\d%K%P
「那、那么，再多看看情况如何？\n反正也住得很近，想见的话随时都…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dNo... that's not true.\d%K%P
「不…那是自欺欺人」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dIf I don't say anything now, there'll be nothing.\nWhat little we had will all disappear.\d%K%P
「如果不在此时说些什么的话，我们就不再会有交集了。\n会就这样自然消亡的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI-I don't think so.\nI mean, you're friends now, aren't you?\d%K%P
「我、我觉得不会那样的。\n因为你们，是朋友吧？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dNo... if I don't do anything now, I'll never have enough\ncourage to talk to him again.\d%K%P
「不行的…\n一旦毕业了，\n就连和他说话的勇气也没有了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMs. Honda...\d%K%P
「本田同学…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dWe ended up chatting mostly because we went to the same\nclass. I could even use school-related matters as an\nexcuse to call him.\d%K%P
「一直以来，我们每天都见面，所以能够轻松对话。\n以学校活动等等为理由，也可以通电话」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAn excuse, huh...\d%K%P
「理由…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dBut once I graduate, that will all come to an end. I'll\nhave to use something direct like \dI want to meet you\d or\n\dI wanted to hear your voice\d as reasons.\d%K%P
「但是毕业以后，就什么理由都没有了。\n只是以想见面、想要听对方的声音为理由，\n是无法通电话的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dTh-That's... um...\d%K%P
「那、那是…呃…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dI don't have the courage to do that.\nI have to know how he feels first.\d%K%P
「我还没有那种勇气…\n没有确认对方的心意，那种事我做不到」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHow he feels, hm...\d%K%P
「对方的心意…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dSo if I hesitate here, it's all over.\nI won't be able to call, and as a result, I won't be able\nto see him, either.\d%K%P
「已经不能像这样再犹豫不决了。\n电话不敢打，约定成了泡影…然后连见面的勇气都失去」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dY... You won't be able to see him anymore?\d%K%P
「见…见面的勇气？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dOne month will pass... then two... and before long, not\nseeing each other will become the norm.\d%K%P
「就像那样过去一个月、两个月，\n见不到的时间就会渐渐变得理所当然了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dWe'll both be busy with our new lives, and I'm scared\nthat everything we had will just vanish.\d%K%P
「我和他都会忙于新的生活…\n像那样…淡忘下去，我害怕这样…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...!\d%K%P
「…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dSo basically, I won't be able to meet him after\ngraduation.\nOnce I lose my excuse... everything will just stop in\nplace.\d%K%P
「呐…毕业后再见面什么的，是假的吧？\n如果没有约定的话…就到此为止了啊，老师」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dStop in place...?\nIf you don't have an excuse, it's the end?\d%K%P
「到此…为止？\n没有约定…就到此为止…？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dMs. Kouno...! What do you think I should do?\nShould I confess now, even though I know I'll be turned\ndown?\d%K%P
「呐，老师…\n我，该怎么办才好？\n虽然知道很勉强，但也只能表白了么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...What should I do?\d%K%P
「………怎么办」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dThat's what I'm asking your advice for!\d%K%P
「所以，想和您一起考虑…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWe've lost our excuse...\nThere's no reason for us to be meeting anymore...\d%K%P
「我们的交集，消失了啊…\n见面什么的，已经不能了啊…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dUm... I'm not talking about you...\d%K%P
「那个，说的不是老师的事…」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
The 29th of February.%K%P
－２月２９日－%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnd he said he would make it up to me...!\d%K%P
「明明说过要补偿的…」%K%P
%LCAnnouncer
%LC电话音
\d\dWe're sorry; you have reached a number that has been\ndisconnected or is no longer in service.\d\d%K%P
「您所拨打的电话目前不在服务区，\n或处于关机状态」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's been two weeks, for goodness' sake!\d%K%P
「把我扔下２周不管是什么意思啊！」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dEek?!\d%K%P
「呀！？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, I'm sorry! A textbook I ordered online is taking too\nlong to arrive, and it's been eating at me!\d%K%P
「啊啊够了！\n向业者订的新年度手册还没送到！\n不是吧，我也真是的！」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dO-Oh, I see. I don't think I've ever seen you angry\nbefore, so that startled me.\d%K%P
「是、是那样吗？\n平时性情温厚的香野老师突然发起怒来时还真有魄力啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm really sorry.\nI can't have my pupils see me like this.\d%K%P
「真的很抱歉。\n这种样子，可不能让学生看到」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dOh, don't worry about it, teachers are people too. It\nsounds like you're in a tough spot, though. It's unusual\nfor a delivery service to be that late. ...Do you want me\nto get the principal to look into it?\d%K%P
「不不，老师也是人啊。\n不过也真是困扰了啊，竟然联系不上业者。\n…要不去和教导主任商量商量？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
%XS10\dIf you do, I won't get another class for as long as I live.\d %XE%K%P
「要是找他去谈这种事的话，我就不可能再当班主任了」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dIs there anything I can do to help?\nMaybe look for a different service, and...\d%K%P
「我能帮上什么忙吗？\n要不去找找别的业者…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'll try calling the provider directly. I appreciate the\nconcern, but I'd rather take care of it myself.\d%K%P
「我直接给印刷厂打电话吧！\n多谢您的关心！」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCKinoshita
%LC木下
\dUm, Ms. Sawashima...\d%K%P
「那个，泽嶋小姐…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHm? Is it for me?\d%K%P
「嗯？找我？」%K%P
%LCKinoshita
%LC木下
\dNo, it's for Mr. Yoshimura, but as you know, he's\ncurrently on a vacation. It's from his wife... she says\nher name is Yamada.\d%K%P
「不，找休假中的芳村先生。\n…自称是芳村夫人的山田小姐」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Connect it to me.\d%K%P
「………接到这边来」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dH... Hot springs?!\d%K%P
「温………温泉！？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dYeah, a four day vacation to Gero Hot Springs. He's just\nfinished a huge project and hasn't taken any days off, so\nI figured I'd give him some time off.\d%K%P
「说是去下吕温泉还有那附近玩个四天三宿。\n嘛，大工程也结束了，\n最近的周六日他也没休息过，我就许可了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI-Isn't that in Gifu?! As in, his home prefecture?\n...Well, his actual home is still a two-hour car ride away\nfrom those hot springs, though.\d%K%P
「那、那不是在岐阜吗！\n那不就是理老家所在的当地吗！\n…虽然从那里到老家坐车要花上个２小时就是了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHe said he's gonna spend all his time playing table\ntennis and Space Invaders, then eat enough hot spring eggs\nto last a lifetime. He's even started to sound like an old\nman lately.\d%K%P
「说是要享受一下乒乓球、温泉蛋、侵略者电子游戏。\n真有老头子作风啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhy...?\d%K%P
「为什么…？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWell, I guess it's a kind of graduation trip, plus a\npresent for passing the exams.\d%K%P
「那个嘛…是庆祝合格的旅行兼毕业旅行」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHe's there with Mitoko?!\d%K%P
「和美都子…一起…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWell, it's true that Toko is there with him, but...\d%K%P
「嘛，的确和小都子一起就是了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHe went to introduce her to his parents...\d%K%P
「向老家…问候（见家长）？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWell, I imagine they'll drop by his home for a quick\nvisit.\d%K%P
「那个嘛，也许会去去吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo way... I can't believe this...\d%K%P
「骗人…那种事，骗人的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dExcuse me, can I get another glass of cola?\d%K%P
「啊，不好意思，再来一杯可乐」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu took Mitoko, and... and... they'll... Aaaaaah!\d%K%P
「终于，和美都子…？\n理…理…啊啊啊啊啊！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dOh, and one sausage platter, please.\d%K%P
「啊…香肠拼盘也来一份」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThis is it! I'm done for! And Osamu, too! As far as\ncommon decency is concerned, at least!\d%K%P
「我，已经完了～！\n而且理也完蛋了～，在社会上」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThere she goes again...\d%K%P
「又开始了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dH-How can you be so calm about this?! Are you not worried\nabout Mitoko?! I thought you loved her!\d%K%P
「你、你为什么这么平静啊！\n就不担心美都子吗？\n平时的独占欲跑哪里去了～！？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWell, a few things happened, so...\d%K%P
「嘛，发生了很多事…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat should I do...?\nWhat am I supposed to do in this situation?!\d%K%P
「怎么办…\n呐，我该怎么办啊？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThere's nothing you can do. I mean, you just can't help\nacting like Ms. Perfect in front of Osamu, right? The kind\nthat would say \dgo on without me\d as the army of baddies\nrushed in.\d%K%P
「什么怎么办的。\n你在理先生面前，不也立刻就摆出一副好脸色吗。\n『你先走，这里交给我』像这样的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can't change the way he sees me that easily...\d%K%P
「可我已经被钉死在那种立场上了…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI bet you'd be in a different place right now if you had\nthe guts to ask him to marry you again. I mean, weren't\nthe one who proposed the first time?\d%K%P
「『再和我结婚吧』这样向他请求一次的话，\n现在的关系不就可以改变了么？\n再说，第一次结婚时也是你发起攻势的吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI was, sure. I'm well aware that Osamu hasn't proposed to\nme even once, thank you very much.\d%K%P
「诶～诶～是啊。\n反正我一次也没有被理求过婚～」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dJesus, I can't take this anymore.\nI wonder where Kaya is frolicking around at this hour.\d%K%P
「啊～我受够了，忍受不了了。\n夏夜小姐究竟在哪闲逛啊～」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's right. I'm no good. Osamu has to find true\nhappiness for himself. He's got no use for women who can't\nbear children. I should know my place...\d%K%P
「是啊，不行的…\n理应该去抓住普通的幸福。\n像我这种没有生育能力的女人，是不行的…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI won't even try to comment on that.\d%K%P
「我绝对不会评论你刚才的话」%K%P
%LCAnnouncer
%LC电话音
\d\dUm... we're sorry; you have reached a number that has\nbeen disconnected or is no longer in service.\d\d%K%P
「诶～，您所拨打的电话目前不在服务区，\n或者对方不想接听」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dDon't cut me off, Kaya!\nI don't want to be left behind in this gloomy place all\nalone!\d%K%P
「不要丢下我啊，夏夜小姐！\n我才不愿意留在这种阴郁的地方呢！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm sorry. Can I have a bottle of this red wine?\d%K%P
「不好意思，这红酒，来一整瓶…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI can still vividly remember how I kept calling you in\nthe exact same situation, but you totally ditched me and\nwent to have drinks with Osamu instead.\d%K%P
「之前我这么想的时候也一直给你打电话了吧…\n但公主你选择无视了我，和理君两人去喝酒了吧？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI'm sorry about that! Look, I'm footing the bill, so\nplease...!\nShe's getting more and more depressed by the minute!\d%K%P
「我道歉！我请客！所以你快来吧！\n这个人眼看着就要坏掉了啊～！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI was forced to keep her company for three hours.\d%K%P
「这种状态下，我已经陪她３个小时了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNgh, ngh, ngh...\d%K%P
「嗯咕、嗯咕、嗯咕…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dIf you don't come, I'll bring her back to your room,\nokay?\d%K%P
「如果你现在不来的话，\n我就把她带回到５号房了哦？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...How screwed up is that?!\d%K%P
「…太卑鄙了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThat's how the Sawashimas rose to the top.\d%K%P
「我泽嶋家，就是这么发迹的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm done for!!\d%K%P
「我已经，不行不行了～！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUah, hyah... fwehh... I thought... I thought I finally\nmanaged to forget him, so why... why did I have to run\ninto him again...\d%K%P
「呜呜、呜呜…呜呜…\n明明好不容易…好不容易觉得自己终于能忘掉了。\n为什么还要让我相遇一次啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...I'll be there in thirty minutes.\nBut you're free to leave if you're done before I arrive.\d%K%P
「…等我３０分钟。\n那之后你再回去都行」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWe'll be waiting! Well, I can't guarantee I'll be here by\nthe time you come, but she certainly will!\d%K%P
「绝对会等的！\n虽说到时候也许只剩夫人了吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNm, nmh...\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAnd... have you managed to keep that thing a secret so\nfar?\d%K%P
「还有…\n那件事有好好保密吗？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Why else do you think she's like this?\d%K%P
「…所以说她才会消沉至极啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dZzzz... ngh, nmh...\d%K%P
「呜呜呜…嗯、嗯…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWe've got to let her ripen before the battle starts.\nDon't tell her anything until she starts showing\nwithdrawal symptoms.\d%K%P
「必须要在时机足够成熟以后再来决胜负啊。\n在禁断症状出现之前绝不要说出来」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dGood grief. What have we done to deserve this?\d%K%P
「真是的，为什么我们得遭这个罪啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dKhh... fwh... nm...\d%K%P
「呜呜…呼…嗯…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt's for a man we all fell for, right?\nWe can't abandon him now.\d%K%P
「这是为了你曾经迷上过的男人吧？\n可别疏忽大意啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dPhew... talk about burdensome men...\d%K%P
「呼…真是麻烦人」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu... wait, this position is too embarrassing...\d%K%P
「理…不要，这种样子，太难为情了…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dDon't start dreaming about weird crap the moment you fall\nasleep!\d%K%P
「不要一睡着就做奇怪的梦啊！」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
The 1st of March.%K%P
－３月１日－%K%P
%LCPostman
%LC送货员
\dMs. Kouno! Ms. Kouno!\nThere's a parcel for you!\d%K%P
「香野小姐，香野小～姐！\n有您的快递～！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dStop... please stop shouting...\nMy head's gonna split... from all those drinks\nyesterday...\d%K%P
「够了够了…\n脑子里嗡嗡的～。\n昨晚喝多了啊～」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dPhwahh... What on earth do they want from me so early in\nthe morning? What's this?\d%K%P
「呼啊啊…什么啊，一大清早的。\n这是什么啊？」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dGero no Kaori.\d%K%P
「下○之香」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Upwh.\d%K%P
「………噗」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
The 3rd of March.%K%P
－３月７日－%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Ugh.\d%K%P
「…呜呜」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dIs something the matter, Ms. Kouno?\nYou don't seem to have been feeling well for the past few\ndays.\d%K%P
「怎么了，香野老师？\n感觉最近你的脸色不好啊？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh... no, it's just... I had trouble sleeping lately.\d%K%P
「啊…不，只是，\n最近没怎么休息过」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dDo you think you might be ill?\d%K%P
「身体情况如何？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, I don't think so.\nIt's just... you know... I'm feeling kind of down, that's\nall.\d%K%P
「不，也不是那么回事，\n只是感觉，那个…提不起劲」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dIt was your first time being responsible for third-years.\nIt can't be easy realizing they'll all be gone come next\nyear.\d%K%P
「香野老师是第一次担任三年级的班主任吧。\n下周终于要告别了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dGraduation, huh...\d%K%P
「毕业典礼…么」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dFor a while, it's going to feel like a void has opened in\nyour heart. But you get used to it after the first few\ntimes.\d%K%P
「也许在一段时间里会有胸口裂开的感觉。\n嘛，多经历几次就习惯了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I'm gonna have to deal with that on top of -this-?\nJust kill me now.\d%K%P
「…还要经历这种痛苦？\n饶了我吧」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dExcuse me?\d%K%P
「什么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHahhh...\d%K%P
「哈啊啊啊啊～」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dM-Ms. Kouno?\d%K%P
「香、香野老师？」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dOh my... she really is taking it hard.\d%K%P
「哎呀呀…这可是重症啊」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dOh, Mr. Moriyama?\nHave you started smoking again?\d%K%P
「啊啦，森山老师？\n又开始吸烟了么？」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dWhoops... You got me.\d%K%P
「哦哦…露馅了啊」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dI recall you saying you'd stay away from it after they\nfound that suspicious shadow around your lungs during our\nlast medical check-up.\d%K%P
「我记得你上次拍了肺部的片，\n说是要下决心戒烟的啊」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dYeah, and I did actually stop for three months or so, but\nthen I took another X-ray the other day and they couldn't\nfind anything resembling a shadow.\d%K%P
「嗯，不过戒了三个月就放弃了。\n其实之后又做过二次检查，拍出了详细的片子，\n结果发现里面干净着呢…」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\d...And that made you take up smoking again?\nAfter you've already quit...?\d%K%P
「…那，戒烟也放弃了？\n难得都快戒掉了的」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dI got relieved, and as I was walking home from the\nhospital, I figured I might as well smoke one ciggy for\nold times' sake.\d%K%P
「发现没有异常后我就安下了心来。\n然后从医院回来后，我就准备吸最后一支烟…」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dAnd when you did...?\d%K%P
「吸了之后呢？」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dYou've no idea how great it was! I'm not sure if it's\njust because I've been staying away from it for so long,\nbut I felt like I'd gone to heaven.\d%K%P
「那可真是美味啊！\n大概是一直都忍着的缘故吧？\n舒服得都感觉快要升天了」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dI suppose it does get you closer to heaven, in a sense.\d%K%P
「那的确是通向天国的阳光大道啊」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dSo yeah, it was amazing. Way better than it ever was,\neven back when I smoked periodically. In the end, it made\nme even more addicted.\d%K%P
「嘛，比戒烟之前要美味得多啊！\n由于忍耐的缘故，反而导致戒不掉了」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dI can't believe you. Hmph.\d%K%P
「我才不懂，真是的…」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dHolding back too much is bad for you.\nIt only makes you crave the thing even more.\d%K%P
「人类，忍耐是不好的。\n反而会导致更深的堕落啊」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dWhat about your children?\nCome on, Ms. Kouno, say something as well.\d%K%P
「您家里还有孩子啊。\n香野老师也来说点什么吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I totally get it.\d%K%P
「………我懂」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dMs. Kouno...?\d%K%P
「香野老师…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI totally get it, Mr. Moriyama! The overwhelming pleasure\nof finally tasting something you've forced yourself to\navoid for the longest time!\d%K%P
「那个我懂，森山老师！\n长久长久的忍耐之后，\n一不小心打破了禁锢的那种舒适感！」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dEh? Eh?\d%K%P
「诶、诶？」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dU-Um...\d%K%P
「喂、喂…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt gets a hold of you just as firmly as before... no, it\nbecomes even harder to quit. It fills you with so much\nhappiness and pleasure that you're completely powerless to\nresist. I'm so glad I wasn't the only one!\d%K%P
「和放弃之前相同…不，比那更加令人无法自拔。\n开心又兴奋…最后完全陷进去了！\n太好了，不是只有我一个人这样啊」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dO-Oh? I didn't know you were such a talker, Ms. Kouno!\d%K%P
「嘿、嘿诶，您真是懂啊，香野老师」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnd you can feel how it's making you more and more\nhelpless by the day. The hunger overwhelms you... it pains\nyou so bad you spend all your nights crying.\d%K%P
「知道自己越来越没用了…\n很痛苦…真的是痛苦到晚上默默流泪…」%K%P
%LCLady Teacher
%LC女老师
\dAre we still talking about... smoking?\d%K%P
「这个…说的是香烟的话题么？」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
The 13th of March.%K%P
－３月１３日－%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d\dOsamu?\d\d%K%P
『理？』%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d\dAh, Asami? Um... I'm sorry for today.\nI was the one who invited you, but I couldn't make it.\d\d%K%P
『啊，麻实…那个，今天抱歉了…\n明明是我邀请你的，却没有去』%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhy didn't you come...?\nI skipped a meeting at work to make it in time.\d%K%P
「为什么没来啊…\n明明我是连职员会议都翘掉了的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d\dUm, the trains ended up running behind schedule as far\nas I saw, but I don't think any have been cancelled yet.\d\d%K%P
『不…虽然时间表混乱了，\n不过最后总算是运行了』%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThen hurry over here, even if you have to come crawling.\nDon't you want to see me anymore?\d%K%P
「那就爬也要爬着过来啊…\n你，不想见我吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d\dYou don't need to worry about that, I feel better than\never. But, um... something unavoidable suddenly came up,\nso...\d\d%K%P
『那个也没问题了。我现在身体好着呢。\n只是，那个…无论如何也脱不了身…』%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat the hell...? What's that supposed to mean?\d%K%P
「什么啊…什么意思啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d\d...I'm sorry.\d\d%K%P
『………抱歉』%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat do you mean, you're sorry?!\nYou think a few words are enough to make me forgive you?!\d%K%P
「不是“抱歉”吧！\n你觉得道歉就能了事吗！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d\dR-Really...?\d\d%K%P
『是、是么…？』%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDo I need to spell everything out for you?! Stop\ninterpreting things in the way that's the most convenient\nfor you!\d%K%P
「给我察觉到这一点啊！\n只会做这种一厢情愿的自我安慰！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d\dYeah, I'm safe and sound. You've got nothing to worry\nabout on that front. It's just that... I can't leave her\nalone right now...\d\d%K%P
『嗯，那些也没问题。\n只是…现在我得在身边跟着…』%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBe with me...\d%K%P
「到我身边来啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d\dI'm really sorry! I'll make it up to you! I'll call you\nlater!\d\d%K%P
『真的很抱歉！\n下次我会补偿的。\n再联系啦！』%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBut when? When will that be?\nWhen in the world are you gonna make that call...?!\d%K%P
