%LC麻实
\dW-Wait! J-Just give me a moment!\d%K%P
「等、等一下！\n稍微等一下啊！」%K%P
It made me wonder... Just how many times did she rehearse\nthe heated scolding she gave me an hour or so earlier?%K%P
就在一个小时之前，\n麻实还以咄咄逼人的气势大声斥责我，\n对于那样的场景，她到底进行了多少次的预演呢？%K%P
This time, however, she had no time to improvise. She\nturned her back on me and inhaled three deep breaths.%K%P
但现在，由于突然的展开，即兴演戏似乎都跟不上了，\n她一度背对着我，擦了擦眼睛，做了三次深呼吸后…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMitoko has finally graduated!\nYour efforts have certainly paid off, haven't they?\d%K%P
「恭喜美都子毕业。\n长久的努力真是值了啊，理」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami...\d%K%P
「麻实…」%K%P
By the time she looked me in the eye again, Asami was once\nagain \dMs. Kouno,\d a woman that only maintained a casual\nfriendship with her former husband.%K%P
然后转过身的时候，麻实完美地变成了『香野老师』\n和『离婚后以朋友身份继续相处的前妻』。%K%P
Her tears were those of a teacher saddened by the loss of\nher beloved students, while her smile remained just as\ngentle as it had always been.%K%P
眼里含着一点泪，是因为不舍得和毕业生离别。\n除此之外是一如既往的淡淡微笑和平易近人的温柔。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou'll have to keep on working hard.\nThe two of you have a boarding house to maintain.\d%K%P
「不过，从现在开始还要一直努力下去哦。\n得和她一起守着那公寓啊」%K%P
Asami's voice took on an enlightened tone -- as though she\nhad long since put everything behind her. The words she\nspoke backed this up.%K%P
以及，达观的口吻，\n和符合那口吻的台词。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSo, um... if there's anything I can still do, don't be\nafraid to ask. I, uh, too... would like keep on supporting\nher... if possible...\d%K%P
「所以呢，那个…\n从今以后如果有什么需要的话，就毫不客气地说出来吧。\n我也会…嗯…从今以后也会帮助那孩子的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami.\d%K%P
「麻实」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
Asami was startled by my voice, which came out somewhat\nlouder than usual.%K%P
我的声音只不过稍微变大了而已，\n但麻实确是吓了一跳，并且反应有点过激。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry for standing you up.\nAnd for not contacting you for a month.\d%K%P
「抱歉，我爽约了。\n还有，一个月没和你联系」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI-It's nothing! I mean, you missed a month's worth of\nwork last year due to your injury, right? I imagine you\nhad to use up all your free time just to make up for\nthat.\d%K%P
「那、那种事无所谓啦！\n因为理，去年不是因为受伤休假了嘛。\n要努力把工作赶回来才行啊！」%K%P
She obviously overreacted to a simple apology.%K%P
只是道个歉而已，就让她紧张过头了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnd you sent me a present, right?\nThanks. Everyone at work tried it.\d%K%P
「而且，你还不是送特产了吗。\n谢啦。在办公室和大家一起分着吃了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, that... I dropped by my parents' place while I was\ntraveling.\d%K%P
「啊，那个没什么，\n旅行的时候顺便从老家寄过去的…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI heard it was a trip to celebrate her graduation!\nI bet Mitoko was elated!\d%K%P
「听说是毕业旅行吧？\n美都子很开心吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh? S-Sure, but...\d%K%P
「诶？啊、嗯，不过…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou spent all that time together, huh?\nAs in... just the two of you?\d%K%P
「应该一直在一起吧。\n和那孩子…一起，对吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah, we were together, but that's...\d%K%P
「嗯，是在一起。\n但那个是…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, I suppose it's none of my business.\nI mean, I have no say in what you do with your life.\d%K%P
「嘛，也没什么，和我也没什么太大关系。\n因为，我没有权利对理的选择说三道四…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami?\d%K%P
「麻实？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, which reminds me... Everyone's waiting for me, so I\ngotta run. Um, c-can I contact you again?\d%K%P
「啊，对了、大家还在等着我呢。我得赶紧回去了。\n以、以后可以再联系吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSorry, but do you have another minute? There's something\nI need to tell you. It won't take long.\d%K%P
「抱歉，再给我一点时间。\n很快就能说完了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, I'll be on spring vacation starting tomorrow, so\nyou can contact me any time.\d%K%P
「要、要进入春假了，\n从明天开始有的是时间」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat won't do. It would only dull my resolve.\d%K%P
「不行，那样会动摇我的决心…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUm... I'm not entirely sure what you're talking about,\nbut you can take your time to think about it. I mean,\nthere's nothing between us that would need to be discussed\nin a hurry, right?\d%K%P
「那个，虽然不知道你想说什么，\n不过花一段时间慢慢考虑后再说也不迟啊。\n我们之间、没什么可着急的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dListen to me...\d%K%P
「请听我说…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...No.\d%K%P
「………不」%K%P
Her mood seemed to fluctuate wildly as she kept\ninterrupting me with pointless distractions, no doubt in\nan attempt to delay what I wanted to say.%K%P
格外高涨的情绪，嘴上残留着的无用话语，\n不管是结论还是约定，都是渴望延后的逃避与忐忑。%K%P
She quite obviously wasn't her usual self.%K%P
麻实她，明显失去了平常心，对我，还有对她自己。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThere's something important I need to tell you.\d%K%P
「我有话要对麻实说」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI don't think there's anything I want to hear from you.\d%K%P
「我倒没什么想听的…」%K%P
I wasn't sure if the sentimental mood of the graduation\nceremony or some other reason was to blame here. Despite\nhaving shared a roof with Asami for years, I still\ncouldn't fully understand her. And yet...%K%P
不管它源于毕业典礼的感伤还是别的什么，\n到现在为止什么都不懂得的我，\n也不可能弄明白…%K%P
...I knew that now was the time to strike.%K%P
只清楚一点…\n现在就是攻略的时刻，这一点就足够了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry it took me this long to come to a decision...\nwell, I actually spent more time thinking about how to say\nit, but...\d%K%P
「得出结论的话…不，不对。\n该怎么传达呢，我考虑了很多…\n花了这么长的时间…真的、对不起」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dLook, I don't want to hear anything, okay?!\d%K%P
「都说啦，我什么都不想听…」%K%P
Asami kept avoiding my gaze whenever I looked at her, but\nwould steal glances at me whenever I myself looked in\nanother direction.%K%P
当我低下头，麻实就偷偷地，不知所措地看着我的脸。\n当我抬起头来看着她，麻实就故作恍惚地，羞涩地移开视线。\n这一切，我都看在眼里，我都知道……%K%P
We could see each other's expressions, but our eyes\nwouldn't meet.%K%P
两个人，像是闹别扭的小孩子般，\n凌乱地捕捉着对方的表情，期待着并逃避者对方的视线，\n留给心的，除了空白，还是空白。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHearing this from me now might only add to your list of\nworries, but...\d%K%P
「都到现在了才提出这件事，\n是因为对麻实来说，这也许会成为非常困扰的事吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt will! Yes, it will! I'm satisfied with how we are\nright now!\d%K%P
「困扰，对，会困扰的！\n我只要保持现在这样就可以了！」%K%P
Asami was terrified by my words.\nShe was terrified by the possibility of our relationship\nchanging.%K%P
麻实恐惧着我的话语。\n害怕我们现在的关系发生变化。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI promised Toko I'd clear everything up. That I'd get rid\nof loose ends.\d%K%P
「也和都子约好了。\n要把话说清楚」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhy is it that you never listen to my wishes, but always\nto hers?\d%K%P
「为什么你不听我的请求啊？\n为什么总是选择那孩子…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf we continue like this, I'll only keep on hurting you.\d%K%P
「因为照现在这样下去，我只会一直伤害麻实…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI don't feel that way! I'm... I'm happy with the way\nthings are now!\d%K%P
「我可从来没那么想！\n现在…像现在这样就够幸福了！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, I'll say it.\nAsami, I... um...!\d%K%P
「不，我要说。\n麻实，那、那个、那个…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo! I won't listen!\d%K%P
「不要！绝对不要！」%K%P
%LCOsamu & Asami
%LC理＆麻实
\dPlease marry me again!\d\n\dDon't abandon me!\d%K%P
「请再和我结一次婚！」\n「求求你不要抛弃我！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
We, uh...%K%P
总感觉…%K%P
...We weren't exactly on the same page here.%K%P
总感觉，这对话是不是从一开始就大相径庭了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, listen... you're no longer the Osamu that divorced\nMs. Kouno. You're no longer lacking in anything.\d%K%P
「呐、理君…\n现在的理君，已经不是那个和老师分手时，\n『残缺的理君』了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou raised me to the best of your ability, and loved\nme... as a daughter. You're already pretty much a full-\nfledged parent at this point, although maybe a tad\noverprotective.\d%K%P
「拼命努力来养育我…\n一直把我当作“女儿”来爱…\n…不，你成了一个普通的，为女儿操心的父亲了哦？」%K%P
Toko was crying in front of my eyes.%K%P
都子哭了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThere's no longer anything separating you two. The very\nreason you parted ways has vanished. It's gone.\d%K%P
「所以…\n理君和老师之间，已经没有什么障碍了…\n两人分开的理由，已经完全消失了」%K%P
Her shoulders trembled with each new sob, yet Toko did her\nbest to keep her heart strong and resolute -- like a true\nadult would.%K%P
在我的面前。\n小小的肩膀颤抖着。\n只有内心还在拼命逞强。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean, isn't it... isn't it obvious at this point?\d%K%P
「因为、因为…\n那种事，不是理所当然的吗，呐？」%K%P
All in order to help me make my decision.%K%P
之所以能够做出抉择…%K%P
Whether I chose her or Asami, Toko knew that I would keep\ntorturing myself over the matter.%K%P
是因为我知道不管选择都子，还是选择麻实，\n…痛苦只会在三个人之间不停地回转。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI could... turn the entire world upside down and I still\nwouldn't be able to find a better dad than you!!\d%K%P
「这么好的爸爸…\n在世界上打着灯笼也找不到啊！」%K%P
Toko tried to give me a way out. A means to escape from\nthe pain I very much deserved.%K%P
都子她…\n甚至想要像这样，\n把我从那种尽是些自作自受式的痛苦中拯救出来…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh...!\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Little by little, I covered the distance between us, my\nfeet crunching on the fresh snow with each step.%K%P
一点点的、一点点的，\n我和都子在没有人走过，没有脚印的雪地里，一步步靠近。%K%P
Upon reaching her, I took Toko into my embrace.%K%P
终于…收入我的臂弯中。\n我拥抱了都子。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry!\d%K%P
「………对不起」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...! Ah, ah... aaahhh... fwahhh, ah, aaahhh!\d%K%P
