So I could convey my decision.%K%P
只是，为了传达我的决定。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAaaaaah... Uaaaaahh...!\nFweehh... ueeeehhh... aaaaahhh...!\d%K%P
「啊啊啊啊啊啊……呜哇啊啊啊…、\n呜诶诶…呜诶诶诶诶诶…啊啊啊啊啊啊～！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko... Toko...!\nI'm sorry... I'm so sorry... Toko.\d%K%P
「都子…都子…，\n对不起、对不住啊…都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu... Osamu, Osamu...\nFwahh... Uaaaaaahhh!!\d%K%P
「理君…理君理君…、\n呜啊啊…呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊～！」%K%P
To convey that I couldn't choose her.%K%P
为了传达…没有选择都子这件事。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWait...\d%K%P
「等…等等啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know it's a shameless proposition after what I've done\nto you. I've caused you nothing but pain, forcing you to\ndeal with my selfishness without ever giving anything in\nreturn...\d%K%P
「一直，一直都让你受着种种委屈、伤害，\n总是一厢情愿地把自己的欲望强加于你…\n事到如今向你提出，我也知道这很自私」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dLook, I'm telling you to slow down...\d%K%P
「所以说让你等等啦…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know I'm in over my head asking something like this\nafter you've already given up on me once, but...\d%K%P
「因为我已经被你抛弃过一次，\n所以也能体会到这是非常自大的要求…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI haven't given up on... ah, but, um...\nWell, I'm sure even you realize that it's out of the\nquestion.\d%K%P
「才没有抛弃…啊，不过，那个…\n怎么会…那当然是不可能的吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut when I learned of the true reason behind our divorce,\nI was hurt and saddened beyond words...\d%K%P
「但是，知道麻实离开我的理由之后，\n我什么也做不到，又痛苦，又伤心…\n这样的，这样的绝望，我不要体会！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's right... I'm no good...\nI can't make you happy, so...\d%K%P
「就是嘛…我是不行的…\n无法让你幸福，所以…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI was furious with myself because of my own stupidity...\nIt was the most frustrating and depressing moment in my\nlife.\d%K%P
「我讨厌自己的愚蠢，\n很是生气、后悔，进而绝望！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, geez! You've got nothing to be depressed about!\nNone of it was your fault!\d%K%P
「啊～，够了，\n所以说，你根本就没必要失落。\n已经没有任何可以让你感受到责任的事了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut as I hit rock bottom, I realized I still had one\nthing left to me -- hope.\d%K%P
「不知失落到什么程度…\n但正是因此在最后…还留着希望」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHope that one day... you might give me another chance.\d%K%P
「麻实或许会再一次\n转向我这边的，这种希望」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh. Eh? Ehh?\nU-Um, Osamu... are you listening to what I'm saying...?\d%K%P
「啊、诶？诶诶？\n等、等等理…你倒是听人家的话啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat you didn't abandon me for good, and that you\nactually... left me for my own sake.\d%K%P
「麻实你并没有抛弃我。\n不仅没有抛弃，你是为我着想，\n才选择离开我的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, um, that's...\nI guess that's a possible interpretation, but...\d%K%P
「啊～，不，那个是…\n也不是说那种解释不能成立，不过～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd if that was true, then maybe... there was still a\nchance you could love me again?\d%K%P
「既然如此，说不定…\n还存在你依然爱着我的可能性」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know it might sound like a self-serving interpretation,\nbut... what do you think?\d%K%P
「虽然这只是我一厢情愿的解释。\n…究竟对不对呢？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I can't answer that.\nThere's no point.\d%K%P
「…那个是回答不了的。\n即使回答了也没有什么意义」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's not true. If that was the case, it would mean we\nfeel the same way. That the reason for our separation has\nvanished.\d%K%P
「有的。\n如果是这样的话，就表示我们两人都抱着同样的心情。\n也就是说麻实离开我的理由消失了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're just sidestepping the issue again.\nThe reason we can't be together is...\d%K%P
「那种说法只是一种借口而已。\n我不能和你在一起是因为…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm no longer the same person I was two years ago.\d%K%P
「我已经不是两年前的我了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dO-Osamu...\d%K%P
「理、理…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn the year after Toko helped me off the streets, I think\nI've learned how to love and appreciate one's family a\nlittle more.\d%K%P
「一年前，被都子收留之后…\n我成为了能够坦率地爱别人、疼爱他人的人了，\n这一点，我稍微有点自满」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
